45ad22ee35e296ebf6c068dbbf46ebaa69e7fb79f843477341f98dd","batchPath":"docs/research/haless-map-20260921/publications/haless-library-20260921-integrated-batch-input.json","batchSha256":"26401307b8e180dfaee63ecab6a726c6fae7c258b3fc0a63669580de86364fb6","mapActorIds":["R62","R69","Y19","Y20","Y24","Y26"],"publishEvent":true}},{"id":"ca09-text-hl26-cr-dragon-probes-1689","year":1689,"endYear":null,"title":"1689年：Dragon南烟州试探行动","description":"原件称Dragon试探Luoyip、Feiten，被防御与新Gommo武器阻退；魔军否认正式发动战争。事件不表示吞并或新边界。","kind":"context","sourceIds":["manual:bwclose26-jadd-wiki-30147","manual:hl26-core-doc-8df803f7acee","manual:hl26-core-unified-haless-918310f82183"],"sourceUrl":"https://anbennar.fandom.com/wiki/The_Command?oldid=30147","sourceTitle":"The Command","mapAction":"none","dateEvidence":{"status":"explicit-source-date","locator":"Command Yanshen //w:p[31]; Unified body/p[638]","note":"year为来源标示的事件或区间起年；正文保留战争跨度。Google原件当前快照的修订与批准状态未确认。"},"dateStatus":"source-text-year","geometryNote":"仅文本；地名与战争范围不等于EU4省级归属变化。","originRecordId":"manual:hl26-cr-dragon-probes-1689","originBatchId":"manual:hl26-integrated","researchPublication":{"manifestPath":"docs/research/haless-map-20260921/publications/haless-library-20260921-integrated-batch-publication.json","manifestSha256":"a0d897ad645ad22ee35e296ebf6c068dbbf46ebaa69e7fb79f843477341f98dd","batchPath":"docs/research/haless-map-20260921/publications/haless-library-20260921-integrated-batch-input.json","batchSha256":"26401307b8e180dfaee63ecab6a726c6fae7c258b3fc0a63669580de86364fb6","mapActorIds":["R62","R69","Y24","Y20"],"publishEvent":true}},{"id":"ca09-text-hld26-ys-korashi-drill-mk5-luoyip-1697","year":1697,"endYear":1701,"title":"Mk5钻机试制、经Feiten运往Luoyip并进入神庙（Wiki时间链）","description":"固定Wiki叙述1697完成Mk5，1698在Feiten卸货并遇抗议，1701运抵Luoyip神庙并钻开入口。内部陷阱和狭窄通道继续拖延；此时并无整个神庙立刻清空、毁灭或政权更替的结论。本文沿同一Gommo年表稿系，作为可审查来源叙述。","kind":"context","sourceIds":["manual:hld26-ys-wiki-3308-20217"],"sourceUrl":"https://anbennar.fandom.com/wiki/Korashi_Drill?oldid=20217","sourceTitle":"Anbennar Wiki: Korashi Drill","mapAction":"none","dateEvidence":{"exactYear":null,"sourceStartYear":1697,"sourceEndYear":1701,"precision":"source-explicit-sequence","dateIsHistoricalFact":false,"sourceIds":["manual:hld26-ys-wiki-3308-20217"]},"dateStatus":"source-interval","geometryNote":"Textual assertion only; actor/place names do not establish a complete province transfer or boundary.","originRecordId":"manual:hld26-ys-korashi-drill-mk5-luoyip-1697","originBatchId":"manual:hld26-integrated","researchPublication":{"manifestPath":"docs/research/haless-map-20260921/publications/haless-deep-research-20260921-integrated-batch-publication.json","manifestSha256":"61659cb4f4838e347c2d3300997362a0cd676c7c1dba7cd4983004ea214e6215","batchPath":"docs/research/haless-map-20260921/publications/haless-deep-research-20260921-integrated-batch-input.json","batchSha256":"bd18d6a8d8b3bf8007730b4c0ff0a69e5608ad29c64e49a2c0c82b57aa9dc93c","mapActorIds":["Y19","Y20","Y24","v3:Y03","v3:Y05","v3:Y06"],"publishEvent":true}},{"id":"ca09-text-hle26-ys-yangcheng-chemistry-1699","year":1699,"endYear":null,"title":"本地理念：Yangcheng学院的氢气研究","description":"理念称1699为改良Feiten热气球而研究，发现氢气。采用技术叙述的原年，但不以此证明两地当时独立或后续气球技术已完成。","kind":"context","sourceIds":["manual:ss26-fah-src-19399ed2d17857ad"],"sourceUrl":"https://gitlab.com/anbennar/anbennar-eu4-dev/-/blob/new-master/localisation/anb_powers_and_ideas_l_english.yml","sourceTitle":"anb_powers_and_ideas_l_english.yml","mapAction":"none","dateEvidence":{"type":"local-idea-explicit-year","exactYear":1699,"dateIsHistoricalFact":false,"evidenceScope":"本地理念文学与设定叙述；未经独立正史来源确认；不因理念可解锁而证明该年国家存在。","locators":[{"sourceId":"manual:ss26-fah-src-19399ed2d17857ad","path":"localisation/anb_powers_and_ideas_l_english.yml","line":8032,"key":"Y06_xuezhe_of_the_chemics_desc","excerpt":"The second major field in which the Yangcheng college excels is chemistry. The Xuézhe of this faculty have spent many years researching with different elements, making some di